11) is not idly anymore.\r\n@CharacterBody3D@5 (9223372129968326294) starts walking.\r\n```\r\nThis only happens when I instantiate both scenes in the same frame. I'm using C# in my project.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193782645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196057867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108216#issuecomment-3196057867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108216","id":3196057867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-f_kL","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T10:17:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T10:18:05Z","body":"@Skalli Your description sounds a bit different from what this PR aimed to fix. Could you please create a new issue and attach a minimal reproduction project to it?\r\n\r\nThere was another `local_to_scene` fix (#109377) merged shortly after 4.5-beta5 was cut, but I 